  "enableVjster": ["Enable VJster (the Chrome extension connects to Fadester Companion)","Activar VJster (la extensión de Chrome se conecta al puente)","Activer VJster (l’extension Chrome se connecte au compagnon)","启用 VJster（Chrome 扩展程序连接到此伴侣程序）","VJster aktivieren (die Chrome-Erweiterung verbindet sich mit dem Begleitprogramm)","Attiva VJster (l’estensione Chrome si collega al companion)","VJster を有効にする（Chrome 拡張機能がこのコンパニオンに接続します）","VJster 사용 (Chrome 확장 프로그램이 컴패니언에 연결됩니다)","Включить VJster (расширение Chrome подключается к компаньону)","啟用 VJster（Chrome 擴充功能會連線到此伴隨程式）","VJster inschakelen (de Chrome-extensie maakt verbinding met Fadester Companion)","Ativar o VJster (a extensão do Chrome se conecta ao Fadester Companion)","VJster'ı etkinleştir (Chrome uzantısı Fadester Companion'a bağlanır)"],
