  "macNativeHelper": ["Native helper window…","Ventana del asistente nativo…","Fenêtre de l’assistant natif…","原生助手窗口…","Fenster des nativen Helfers…","Finestra dell’helper nativo…","ネイティブヘルパーのウィンドウ…","기본 도우미 창…","Окно встроенного помощника…","原生輔助程式視窗…","Venster van de T-bar-helper…","Janela do auxiliar nativo…","Yerel yardımcı penceresi…"],
  "macNativeMissing": ["The native permission component is missing from this app.","Falta el componente de permisos nativo en esta app.","Le composant d’autorisation natif est absent de cette app.","此应用缺少原生权限组件。","In dieser App fehlt die native Berechtigungskomponente.","In questa app manca il componente nativo dei permessi.","このアプリにはネイティブの権限コンポーネントがありません。","이 앱에 기본 권한 구성 요소가 없습니다.","В приложении нет встроенного компонента разрешений.","此應用程式缺少原生權限元件。","Het onderdeel voor de toestemming ontbreekt in deze app.","O componente de permissão nativo está faltando neste app.","Yerel izin bileşeni bu uygulamada eksik."],
  "macNativeOpenFailed": ["Could not open the native permission window. Check that the whole app was extracted.","No se pudo abrir la ventana de permisos nativa. Comprueba que se extrajo toda la app.","Impossible d’ouvrir la fenêtre d’autorisation native. Vérifiez que toute l’app a été extraite.","无法打开原生权限窗口。请确认已解压整个应用。","Das native Berechtigungsfenster ließ sich nicht öffnen. Prüfen Sie, ob die ganze App entpackt wurde.","Impossibile aprire la finestra nativa dei permessi. Verifica di aver estratto l’intera app.","ネイティブの権限ウィンドウを開けませんでした。アプリ全体が展開されているか確認してください。","기본 권한 창을 열 수 없습니다. 앱 전체가 압축 해제되었는지 확인하세요.","Не удалось открыть окно разрешений. Проверьте, что приложение распаковано целиком.","無法開啟原生權限視窗。請確認已解壓縮整個應用程式。","Het toestemmingsvenster kon niet worden geopend. Controleer of de hele app is uitgepakt.","Não foi possível abrir a janela de permissão nativa. Confira se o app inteiro foi extraído.","Yerel izin penceresi açılamadı. Uygulamanın tamamının çıkarıldığını kontrol edin."],
  "macNeedPreset": ["Need the preset file? Click “1. Save TourBox Preset (.tb)…” first.","¿Necesitas el archivo del preajuste? Haz clic primero en «1. Guardar preajuste TourBox (.tb)…».","Besoin du fichier de préréglage ? Cliquez d’abord sur « 1. Enregistrer le préréglage TourBox (.tb)… ».","需要预设文件？请先点击「1. 保存 TourBox 预设 (.tb)…」。","Brauchen Sie die Preset-Datei? Klicken Sie zuerst auf „1. TourBox-Preset speichern (.tb)…“.","Ti serve il file del preset? Fai prima clic su «1. Salva preset TourBox (.tb)…».","プリセットファイルが必要ですか？まず「1. TourBox プリセットを保存 (.tb)…」をクリックしてください。","프리셋 파일이 필요하세요? 먼저 “1. TourBox 프리셋 저장(.tb)…”을 클릭하세요.","Нужен файл пресета? Сначала нажмите «1. Сохранить пресет TourBox (.tb)…».","需要預設集檔案？請先按一下「1. 儲存 TourBox 預設集 (.tb)…」。","Heb je het presetbestand nodig? Klik eerst op “1. TourBox-preset (.tb) opslaan…”.","Precisa do arquivo do preset? Clique antes em “1. Salvar preset do TourBox (.tb)…”.","Hazır ayar dosyasına mı ihtiyacınız var? Önce “1. TourBox hazır ayarını (.tb) kaydet…” düğmesine tıklayın."],
  "macObsAppMissing": ["OBS.app was not found in Applications. Start OBS Studio yourself.","No se encontró OBS.app en Aplicaciones. Abre OBS Studio tú mismo.","OBS.app est introuvable dans Applications. Démarrez OBS Studio vous-même.","在「应用程序」中找不到 OBS.app。请手动启动 OBS Studio。","OBS.app wurde unter Programme nicht gefunden. Starten Sie OBS Studio selbst.","OBS.app non trovato in Applicazioni. Avvia OBS Studio manualmente.","アプリケーションフォルダに OBS.app が見つかりません。OBS Studio を手動で起動してください。","응용 프로그램에서 OBS.app을 찾을 수 없습니다. OBS Studio를 직접 실행하세요.","OBS.app не найден в «Программах». Запустите OBS Studio вручную.","在「應用程式」中找不到 OBS.app。請手動啟動 OBS Studio。","OBS.app is niet gevonden in Apps. Start OBS Studio zelf.","OBS.app não foi encontrado em Aplicativos. Inicie o OBS Studio você mesmo.","OBS.app, Uygulamalar klasöründe bulunamadı. OBS Studio'yu kendiniz başlatın."],
  "macObsNotRunning": ["OBS Studio is not running.","OBS Studio no está abierto.","OBS Studio n’est pas lancé.","OBS Studio 未运行。","OBS Studio läuft nicht.","OBS Studio non è avviato.","OBS Studio が起動していません。","OBS Studio가 실행 중이 아닙니다.","OBS Studio не запущен.","OBS Studio 未執行。","OBS Studio is niet gestart.","O OBS Studio não está aberto.","OBS Studio çalışmıyor."],
  "macOpenConsoleStep": ["2. Open TourBox Console","2. Abrir TourBox Console","2. Ouvrir TourBox Console","2. 打开 TourBox Console","2. TourBox Console öffnen","2. Apri TourBox Console","2. TourBox Console を開く","2. TourBox Console 열기","2. Открыть TourBox Console","2. 開啟 TourBox Console","2. TourBox Console openen","2. Abrir o TourBox Console","2. TourBox Console'u aç"],
  "macPasswordHint": ["Leave this empty. Fadester Companion reads the password that OBS saved on this Mac. Type a password here only if the connection fails (Tools → WebSocket Server Settings → Show Connect Info). A typed password is never saved.","Déjalo vacío. Fadester Companion lee la contraseña que OBS guardó en este Mac. Escribe una contraseña aquí solo si la conexión falla (Herramientas → Ajustes del servidor WebSocket → Mostrar información de conexión). Una contraseña escrita nunca se guarda.","Laissez ce champ vide. Fadester Companion lit le mot de passe enregistré par OBS sur ce Mac. Saisissez un mot de passe ici seulement si la connexion échoue (Outils → Paramètres du serveur WebSocket → Afficher les informations de connexion). Un mot de passe saisi n’est jamais enregistré.","请留空。Fadester Companion 会读取 OBS 在此 Mac 上保存的密码。只有连接失败时才在此输入密码（工具 → WebSocket 服务器设置 → 显示连接信息）。输入的密码不会被保存。","Lassen Sie dieses Feld leer. Fadester Companion liest das Passwort, das OBS auf diesem Mac gespeichert hat. Geben Sie hier nur dann ein Passwort ein, wenn die Verbindung fehlschlägt (Werkzeuge → WebSocket-Servereinstellungen → Verbindungsinformationen anzeigen). Ein eingegebenes Passwort wird nie gespeichert.","Lascia vuoto. Fadester Companion legge la password che OBS ha salvato su questo Mac. Inserisci una password qui solo se la connessione non riesce (Strumenti → Impostazioni server WebSocket → Mostra informazioni di connessione). Una password inserita non viene mai salvata.","空欄のままにしてください。Fadester Companion は OBS がこの Mac に保存したパスワードを読み取ります。接続に失敗したときだけ、ここにパスワードを入力してください（ツール → WebSocket サーバー設定 → 接続情報を表示）。入力したパスワードは保存されません。","비워 두세요. Fadester Companion은 OBS가 이 Mac에 저장한 비밀번호를 읽습니다. 연결에 실패할 때만 여기에 비밀번호를 입력하세요(도구 → WebSocket 서버 설정 → 연결 정보 표시). 입력한 비밀번호는 저장되지 않습니다.","Оставьте поле пустым. Fadester Companion читает пароль, который OBS сохранил на этом Mac. Вводите пароль, только если подключение не удаётся (Инструменты → Настройки сервера WebSocket → Показать сведения о подключении). Введённый пароль никогда не сохраняется.","請留空。Fadester Companion 會讀取 OBS 在此 Mac 上儲存的密碼。只有連線失敗時才在此輸入密碼（工具 → WebSocket 伺服器設定 → 顯示連線資訊）。輸入的密碼不會被儲存。","Laat dit leeg. Fadester Companion leest het wachtwoord dat OBS op deze Mac heeft opgeslagen. Typ hier alleen een wachtwoord als verbinden mislukt (Hulpmiddelen → WebSocket-serverinstellingen → Verbindingsinfo tonen). Een getypt wachtwoord wordt nooit opgeslagen.","Deixe em branco. O Fadester Companion lê a senha que o OBS salvou neste Mac. Digite uma senha aqui somente se a conexão falhar (Ferramentas → Configurações do servidor WebSocket → Mostrar informações de conexão). Uma senha digitada nunca é salva.","Burayı boş bırakın. Fadester Companion, OBS'in bu Mac'e kaydettiği parolayı okur. Buraya yalnızca bağlantı başarısız olursa parola yazın (Araçlar → WebSocket Sunucu Ayarları → Bağlantı Bilgisini Göster). Yazılan parola asla kaydedilmez."],
  "macPasswordPlaceholder": ["Only if signing in fails","Solo si la conexión falla","Si la connexion échoue","仅在登录失败时填写","Nur falls Anmeldung scheitert","Solo se l’accesso fallisce","接続に失敗した場合のみ","연결에 실패할 때만","Только если вход не удался","僅在登入失敗時填寫","Alleen als inloggen mislukt","Somente se o login falhar","Yalnızca oturum açma başarısız olursa"],
  "macPresetSaved": ["Saved: {0}. In TourBox Console, import it beside Preset List, turn Auto Switch off and select OBS Fadester for TourBox.","Guardado: {0}. En TourBox Console, impórtalo junto a Preset List, desactiva Auto Switch y selecciona OBS Fadester for TourBox.","Enregistré : {0}. Dans TourBox Console, importez-le à côté de Preset List, désactivez Auto Switch et sélectionnez OBS Fadester for TourBox.","已保存：{0}。在 TourBox Console 中通过 Preset List 旁的按钮导入它，关闭 Auto Switch 并选择 OBS Fadester for TourBox。","Gespeichert: {0}. Importieren Sie es in TourBox Console neben der Preset List, schalten Sie Auto Switch aus und wählen Sie OBS Fadester for TourBox.","Salvato: {0}. In TourBox Console importalo accanto a Preset List, disattiva Auto Switch e seleziona OBS Fadester for TourBox.","保存しました: {0}。TourBox Console で Preset List の横から読み込み、Auto Switch をオフにして OBS Fadester for TourBox を選択します。","저장했습니다: {0}. TourBox Console의 Preset List 옆 버튼으로 가져온 뒤 Auto Switch를 끄고 OBS Fadester for TourBox를 선택하세요.","Сохранено: {0}. В TourBox Console импортируйте его рядом с Preset List, выключите Auto Switch и выберите OBS Fadester for TourBox.","已儲存：{0}。在 TourBox Console 中透過 Preset List 旁的按鈕匯入，關閉 Auto Switch 並選取 OBS Fadester for TourBox。","Opgeslagen: {0}. Importeer het in TourBox Console naast Preset List, zet Auto Switch uit en selecteer OBS Fadester for TourBox.","Salvo: {0}. No TourBox Console, importe-o ao lado de Preset List, desative o Auto Switch e selecione OBS Fadester for TourBox.","Kaydedildi: {0}. TourBox Console'da Preset List'in yanından içe aktarın, Auto Switch'i kapatın ve OBS Fadester for TourBox'ı seçin."],
  "macPresetSavedStatus": ["Saved the Mac TourBox preset in “{0}”.","Preajuste de TourBox para Mac guardado en «{0}».","Préréglage TourBox Mac enregistré dans « {0} ».","已将 Mac TourBox 预设保存到「{0}」。","Mac-TourBox-Preset in „{0}“ gespeichert.","Preset TourBox per Mac salvato in «{0}».","Mac 用 TourBox プリセットを「{0}」に保存しました。","Mac용 TourBox 프리셋을 “{0}”에 저장했습니다.","Пресет TourBox для Mac сохранён в «{0}».","已將 Mac TourBox 預設集儲存到「{0}」。","De Mac-preset voor de TourBox is opgeslagen in “{0}”.","O preset do TourBox para Mac foi salvo em “{0}”.","Mac TourBox hazır ayarı “{0}” içine kaydedildi."],
  "macPresetSquare": ["TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…","TourBox Preset Square…"],
  "macPresetSquareOpened": ["Opened TourBox Preset Square in your browser.","Se abrió TourBox Preset Square en el navegador.","TourBox Preset Square s’est ouvert dans votre navigateur.","已在浏览器中打开 TourBox Preset Square。","TourBox Preset Square wurde im Browser geöffnet.","TourBox Preset Square è stato aperto nel browser.","TourBox Preset Square をブラウザーで開きました。","브라우저에서 TourBox Preset Square를 열었습니다.","TourBox Preset Square открыт в браузере.","已在瀏覽器中開啟 TourBox Preset Square。","TourBox Preset Square is geopend in je browser.","O TourBox Preset Square foi aberto no seu navegador.","TourBox Preset Square tarayıcınızda açıldı."],
  "macPresetSteps": ["1. Click “1. Save TourBox Preset (.tb)…” below to save OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (for example in Downloads).\n2. Click “2. Open TourBox Console”, then click the middle Import [↙] icon beside Preset List and open that .tb file.\n3. Turn Auto Switch off and select OBS Fadester for TourBox: one preset then works whichever app is in front.","1. Haz clic en «1. Guardar preajuste TourBox (.tb)…» abajo para guardar OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (por ejemplo en Descargas).\n2. Haz clic en «2. Abrir TourBox Console», luego en el icono central Import [↙] junto a Preset List, y abre ese archivo .tb.\n3. Desactiva Auto Switch y selecciona OBS Fadester for TourBox: un solo preajuste funciona así con cualquier aplicación delante.","1. Cliquez sur « 1. Enregistrer le préréglage TourBox (.tb)… » ci-dessous pour enregistrer OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (par exemple dans Téléchargements).\n2. Cliquez sur « 2. Ouvrir TourBox Console », puis sur l’icône centrale Import [↙] à côté de Preset List, et ouvrez ce fichier .tb.\n3. Désactivez Auto Switch et sélectionnez OBS Fadester for TourBox : un seul préréglage fonctionne alors quelle que soit l’application au premier plan.","1. 点击下方的「1. 保存 TourBox 预设 (.tb)…」，保存 OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb（例如保存到「下载」）。\n2. 点击「2. 打开 TourBox Console」，然后点击 Preset List 旁中间的 Import [↙] 图标，打开该 .tb 文件。\n3. 关闭 Auto Switch 并选择 OBS Fadester for TourBox：这样一个预设就能在任何应用位于前台时使用。","1. Klicken Sie unten auf „1. TourBox-Preset speichern (.tb)…“, um OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb zu speichern (zum Beispiel in Downloads).\n2. Klicken Sie auf „2. TourBox Console öffnen“, dann neben Preset List auf das mittlere Import-Symbol [↙], und öffnen Sie diese .tb-Datei.\n3. Schalten Sie Auto Switch aus und wählen Sie OBS Fadester for TourBox: Dann funktioniert ein einziges Preset mit jeder App im Vordergrund.","1. Fai clic su «1. Salva preset TourBox (.tb)…» qui sotto per salvare OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (ad esempio in Download).\n2. Fai clic su «2. Apri TourBox Console», poi sull’icona centrale Import [↙] accanto a Preset List, e apri quel file .tb.\n3. Disattiva Auto Switch e seleziona OBS Fadester for TourBox: un solo preset funziona così con qualsiasi app in primo piano.","1. 下の「1. TourBox プリセットを保存 (.tb)…」をクリックして OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb を保存します（例: ダウンロード）。\n2. 「2. TourBox Console を開く」をクリックし、Preset List の横にある中央の Import [↙] アイコンをクリックしてその .tb ファイルを開きます。\n3. Auto Switch をオフにして OBS Fadester for TourBox を選択します。どのアプリが前面でも 1 つのプリセットで動作します。","1. 아래의 “1. TourBox 프리셋 저장(.tb)…”을 클릭해 OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb를 저장하세요(예: 다운로드).\n2. “2. TourBox Console 열기”를 클릭한 뒤 Preset List 옆 가운데의 Import [↙] 아이콘을 클릭해 그 .tb 파일을 여세요.\n3. Auto Switch를 끄고 OBS Fadester for TourBox를 선택하세요. 프리셋 하나로 어떤 앱이 앞에 있어도 작동합니다.","1. Нажмите «1. Сохранить пресет TourBox (.tb)…» ниже, чтобы сохранить OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (например, в «Загрузки»).\n2. Нажмите «2. Открыть TourBox Console», затем среднюю иконку Import [↙] рядом с Preset List и откройте этот файл .tb.\n3. Выключите Auto Switch и выберите OBS Fadester for TourBox: один пресет работает с любым приложением на переднем плане.","1. 按一下下方的「1. 儲存 TourBox 預設集 (.tb)…」，儲存 OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb（例如儲存到「下載項目」）。\n2. 按一下「2. 開啟 TourBox Console」，再按一下 Preset List 旁中間的 Import [↙] 圖示，開啟該 .tb 檔案。\n3. 關閉 Auto Switch 並選取 OBS Fadester for TourBox：這樣一個預設集就能在任何應用程式位於前景時使用。","1. Klik hieronder op “1. TourBox-preset (.tb) opslaan…” om OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb op te slaan (bijvoorbeeld in Downloads).\n2. Klik op “2. TourBox Console openen”, klik dan op het middelste pictogram Import [↙] naast Preset List en open dat .tb-bestand.\n3. Zet Auto Switch uit en selecteer OBS Fadester for TourBox: één preset werkt dan ongeacht welke app op de voorgrond staat.","1. Clique em “1. Salvar preset do TourBox (.tb)…” abaixo para salvar OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb (por exemplo, em Transferências).\n2. Clique em “2. Abrir o TourBox Console”, depois clique no ícone do meio, Import [↙], ao lado de Preset List e abra esse arquivo .tb.\n3. Desative o Auto Switch e selecione OBS Fadester for TourBox: assim um único preset funciona com qualquer app na frente.","1. OBS Fadester for TourBox.tb dosyasını (örneğin İndirilenler'e) kaydetmek için aşağıdaki “1. TourBox hazır ayarını (.tb) kaydet…” düğmesine tıklayın.\n2. “2. TourBox Console'u aç”a tıklayın, sonra Preset List'in yanındaki ortadaki Import [↙] simgesine tıklayıp o .tb dosyasını açın.\n3. Auto Switch'i kapatın ve OBS Fadester for TourBox'ı seçin: böylece tek bir hazır ayar hangi uygulama önde olursa olsun çalışır."],
  "macPresetTitle": ["TourBox Console preset","Preajuste de TourBox Console","Préréglage TourBox Console","TourBox Console 预设","TourBox-Console-Preset","Preset di TourBox Console","TourBox Console プリセット","TourBox Console 프리셋","Пресет TourBox Console","TourBox Console 預設集","Preset voor TourBox Console","Preset do TourBox Console","TourBox Console hazır ayarı"],
  "macPresetUpdated": ["This version of Fadester Companion has an updated Mac TourBox preset (.tb). Click “1. Save Updated Preset (.tb)…” and import it again in TourBox Console.","Esta versión de Fadester Companion trae un preajuste de TourBox para Mac (.tb) actualizado. Haz clic en «1. Guardar preajuste actualizado (.tb)…» y vuelve a importarlo en TourBox Console.","Cette version de Fadester Companion contient un préréglage TourBox Mac (.tb) mis à jour. Cliquez sur « 1. Enregistrer le préréglage mis à jour (.tb)… » et importez-le à nouveau dans TourBox Console.","此版本的 Fadester Companion 包含更新的 Mac TourBox 预设 (.tb)。请点击「1. 保存更新的预设 (.tb)…」，并在 TourBox Console 中重新导入。","Diese Version von Fadester Companion enthält ein aktualisiertes Mac-TourBox-Preset (.tb). Klicken Sie auf „1. Aktualisiertes Preset speichern (.tb)…“ und importieren Sie es erneut in die TourBox Console.","Questa versione di Fadester Companion include un preset TourBox per Mac (.tb) aggiornato. Fai clic su «1. Salva preset aggiornato (.tb)…» e importalo di nuovo in TourBox Console.","このバージョンの Fadester Companion には、更新された Mac 用 TourBox プリセット (.tb) が入っています。「1. 更新されたプリセットを保存 (.tb)…」をクリックし、TourBox Console でもう一度インポートしてください。","이 버전의 Fadester Companion에는 업데이트된 Mac용 TourBox 프리셋(.tb)이 있습니다. “1. 업데이트된 프리셋 저장(.tb)…”을 클릭하고 TourBox Console에서 다시 가져오세요.","В этой версии Fadester Companion есть обновлённый пресет TourBox для Mac (.tb). Нажмите «1. Сохранить обновлённый пресет (.tb)…» и снова импортируйте его в TourBox Console.","此版本的 Fadester Companion 包含更新的 Mac TourBox 預設集 (.tb)。請按一下「1. 儲存更新的預設集 (.tb)…」，並在 TourBox Console 中重新匯入。","Deze versie van Fadester Companion heeft een bijgewerkte Mac-preset voor de TourBox (.tb). Klik op “1. Bijgewerkte preset (.tb) opslaan…” en importeer hem opnieuw in TourBox Console.","Esta versão do Fadester Companion tem um preset do TourBox para Mac (.tb) atualizado. Clique em “1. Salvar preset atualizado (.tb)…” e importe-o de novo no TourBox Console.","Fadester Companion'ın bu sürümünde güncellenmiş bir Mac TourBox hazır ayarı (.tb) var. “1. Güncellenmiş hazır ayarı (.tb) kaydet…” düğmesine tıklayın ve TourBox Console'da yeniden içe aktarın."],
  "macPreviewMatches": ["Preview is the same as Program: turn Scroll to cue a different scene first.","La vista previa es igual al programa: gira Scroll para preparar otra escena primero.","L’aperçu est identique au programme : tournez Scroll pour préparer une autre scène d’abord.","预览与节目相同：请先转动 Scroll 选择另一个场景。","Vorschau und Programm sind gleich: Drehen Sie zuerst Scroll, um eine andere Szene vorzubereiten.","L’anteprima è uguale al programma: gira prima Scroll per preparare un’altra scena.","プレビューがプログラムと同じです。先に Scroll を回して別のシーンを選んでください。","미리 보기가 프로그램과 같습니다. 먼저 Scroll을 돌려 다른 장면을 준비하세요.","Предпросмотр совпадает с программой: сначала поверните Scroll, чтобы выбрать другую сцену.","預覽與節目相同：請先轉動 Scroll 選擇另一個場景。","Voorbeeld is hetzelfde als Programma: draai eerst aan Scroll om een andere scène klaar te zetten.","A Prévia é igual ao Programa: gire Scroll para preparar outra cena primeiro.","Önizleme, Program ile aynı: önce başka bir sahne hazırlamak için Scroll'u çevirin."],
  "macQuit": ["Quit Fadester Companion","Salir de Fadester Companion","Quitter Fadester Companion","退出 Fadester Companion","Fadester Companion beenden","Esci da Fadester Companion","Fadester Companion を終了","Fadester Companion 종료","Завершить Fadester Companion","結束 Fadester Companion","Fadester Companion afsluiten","Encerrar Fadester Companion","Fadester Companion'dan Çık"],
  "macReading": ["Reading OBS… No scenes or levels are changed.","Leyendo OBS… No se cambia ninguna escena ni nivel.","Lecture d’OBS… Aucune scène ni aucun niveau n’est modifié.","正在读取 OBS… 不会更改任何场景或音量。","OBS wird gelesen… Szenen und Pegel bleiben unverändert.","Lettura di OBS… Nessuna scena o livello viene modificato.","OBS を読み込んでいます… シーンや音量は変更しません。","OBS를 읽는 중… 장면이나 레벨은 바뀌지 않습니다.","Чтение OBS… Сцены и уровни не меняются.","正在讀取 OBS… 不會變更任何場景或音量。","OBS lezen… Er worden geen scènes of niveaus gewijzigd.","Lendo o OBS… Nenhuma cena ou nível é alterado.","OBS okunuyor… Hiçbir sahne veya seviye değiştirilmez."],
  "macRemindObsHidden": ["Keep the main OBS window open, not hidden: the T-bar needs it.","Mantén abierta la ventana principal de OBS, sin ocultar: el T-bar la necesita.","Gardez la fenêtre principale d’OBS ouverte, pas masquée : le T-bar en a besoin.","请保持 OBS 主窗口打开，不要隐藏：T-bar 需要它。","Lassen Sie das OBS-Hauptfenster geöffnet, nicht ausgeblendet: Der T-Bar braucht es.","Tieni aperta la finestra principale di OBS, non nascosta: il T-bar ne ha bisogno.","OBS のメインウィンドウを隠さずに開いたままにしてください。T バーに必要です。","OBS 기본 창을 숨기지 말고 열어 두세요. T바에 필요합니다.","Держите главное окно OBS открытым, не скрытым: оно нужно для T-bar.","請保持 OBS 主視窗開啟，不要隱藏：T-bar 需要它。","Houd het hoofdvenster van OBS open, niet verborgen: de T-bar heeft het nodig.","Mantenha a janela principal do OBS aberta, sem ocultar: o T-bar precisa dela.","OBS ana penceresini açık tutun, gizlemeyin: T-bar için gereklidir."],
  "macSaveAnother": ["Save Another Copy…","Guardar otra copia…","Enregistrer une autre copie…","再保存一份…","Weitere Kopie speichern…","Salva un’altra copia…","別のコピーを保存…","다른 사본 저장…","Сохранить ещё одну копию…","再儲存一份…","Nog een kopie opslaan…","Salvar outra cópia…","Başka bir kopya kaydet…"],
  "macSaveDialogMessage": ["Choose a folder you can find, such as Downloads, then import this file in TourBox Console.","Elige una carpeta fácil de encontrar, como Descargas, y luego importa este archivo en TourBox Console.","Choisissez un dossier facile à retrouver, comme Téléchargements, puis importez ce fichier dans TourBox Console.","选择一个容易找到的文件夹（例如「下载」），然后在 TourBox Console 中导入此文件。","Wählen Sie einen Ordner, den Sie wiederfinden, etwa Downloads, und importieren Sie die Datei dann in die TourBox Console.","Scegli una cartella facile da trovare, come Download, poi importa questo file in TourBox Console.","ダウンロードなど見つけやすいフォルダを選び、このファイルを TourBox Console でインポートしてください。","다운로드처럼 찾기 쉬운 폴더를 선택한 뒤 TourBox Console에서 이 파일을 가져오세요.","Выберите папку, которую легко найти, например «Загрузки», затем импортируйте файл в TourBox Console.","選擇容易找到的檔案夾（例如「下載項目」），然後在 TourBox Console 中匯入此檔案。","Kies een map die je kunt terugvinden, zoals Downloads, en importeer dit bestand daarna in TourBox Console.","Escolha uma pasta fácil de achar, como Transferências, e depois importe este arquivo no TourBox Console.","İndirilenler gibi bulabileceğiniz bir klasör seçin, sonra bu dosyayı TourBox Console'da içe aktarın."],
  "macSaveDialogTitle": ["Save the Mac TourBox preset (.tb)","Guardar el preajuste de TourBox para Mac (.tb)","Enregistrer le préréglage TourBox Mac (.tb)","保存 Mac TourBox 预设 (.tb)","Mac-TourBox-Preset speichern (.tb)","Salva il preset TourBox per Mac (.tb)","Mac 用 TourBox プリセットを保存 (.tb)","Mac용 TourBox 프리셋 저장(.tb)","Сохранить пресет TourBox для Mac (.tb)","儲存 Mac TourBox 預設集 (.tb)","De Mac-preset voor de TourBox (.tb) opslaan","Salvar o preset do TourBox para Mac (.tb)","Mac TourBox hazır ayarını (.tb) kaydet"],
  "macSavePreset": ["1. Save TourBox Preset (.tb)…","1. Guardar preajuste TourBox (.tb)…","1. Enregistrer le préréglage TourBox (.tb)…","1. 保存 TourBox 预设 (.tb)…","1. TourBox-Preset speichern (.tb)…","1. Salva preset TourBox (.tb)…","1. TourBox プリセットを保存 (.tb)…","1. TourBox 프리셋 저장(.tb)…","1. Сохранить пресет TourBox (.tb)…","1. 儲存 TourBox 預設集 (.tb)…","1. TourBox-preset (.tb) opslaan…","1. Salvar preset do TourBox (.tb)…","1. TourBox hazır ayarını (.tb) kaydet…"],
  "macSavePresetShort": ["1. Save Preset (.tb)…","1. Guardar preajuste (.tb)…","1. Enregistrer le préréglage (.tb)…","1. 保存预设 (.tb)…","1. Preset speichern (.tb)…","1. Salva preset (.tb)…","1. プリセットを保存 (.tb)…","1. 프리셋 저장(.tb)…","1. Сохранить пресет (.tb)…","1. 儲存預設集 (.tb)…","1. Preset (.tb) opslaan…","1. Salvar preset (.tb)…","1. Hazır ayarı (.tb) kaydet…"],
  "macSavePresetUpdated": ["1. Save Updated Preset (.tb)…","1. Guardar preajuste actualizado (.tb)…","1. Enregistrer le préréglage mis à jour (.tb)…","1. 保存更新的预设 (.tb)…","1. Aktualisiertes Preset speichern (.tb)…","1. Salva preset aggiornato (.tb)…","1. 更新されたプリセットを保存 (.tb)…","1. 업데이트된 프리셋 저장(.tb)…","1. Сохранить обновлённый пресет (.tb)…","1. 儲存更新的預設集 (.tb)…","1. Bijgewerkte preset (.tb) opslaan…","1. Salvar preset atualizado (.tb)…","1. Güncellenmiş hazır ayarı (.tb) kaydet…"],
  "macSettingsRepair": ["Repair or remove panel-config.json in ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox before saving. Your file has not been changed.","Repara o elimina panel-config.json en ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox antes de guardar. Tu archivo no se ha modificado.","Réparez ou supprimez panel-config.json dans ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox avant d’enregistrer. Votre fichier n’a pas été modifié.","保存前请修复或删除 ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox 中的 panel-config.json。你的文件未被更改。","Reparieren oder entfernen Sie panel-config.json in ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox vor dem Speichern. Ihre Datei wurde nicht geändert.","Ripara o rimuovi panel-config.json in ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox prima di salvare. Il tuo file non è stato modificato.","保存する前に ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox の panel-config.json を修復するか削除してください。ファイルは変更されていません。","저장하기 전에 ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox의 panel-config.json을 고치거나 삭제하세요. 파일은 변경되지 않았습니다.","Перед сохранением исправьте или удалите panel-config.json в ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox. Ваш файл не изменён.","儲存前請修復或刪除 ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox 中的 panel-config.json。您的檔案未被變更。","Herstel of verwijder panel-config.json in ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox voordat je opslaat. Je bestand is niet gewijzigd.","Conserte ou remova o panel-config.json em ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox antes de salvar. Seu arquivo não foi alterado.","Kaydetmeden önce ~/Library/Application Support/FadesterTourBox içindeki panel-config.json dosyasını onarın veya kaldırın. Dosyanız değiştirilmedi."],
  "macSettingsUnreadable": ["Saved settings could not be read. Nothing will be overwritten.","No se pudieron leer los ajustes guardados. No se sobrescribirá nada.","Impossible de lire les paramètres enregistrés. Rien ne sera écrasé.","无法读取已保存的设置。不会覆盖任何内容。","Die gespeicherten Einstellungen ließen sich nicht lesen. Es wird nichts überschrieben.","Impossibile leggere le impostazioni salvate. Non verrà sovrascritto nulla.","保存された設定を読み込めませんでした。何も上書きしません。","저장된 설정을 읽을 수 없습니다. 아무것도 덮어쓰지 않습니다.","Не удалось прочитать сохранённые настройки. Ничего не будет перезаписано.","無法讀取已儲存的設定。不會覆寫任何內容。","De opgeslagen instellingen konden niet worden gelezen. Er wordt niets overschreven.","Não foi possível ler as configurações salvas. Nada será sobrescrito.","Kayıtlı ayarlar okunamadı. Hiçbir şeyin üzerine yazılmayacak."],
  "macShowInFinder": ["Show in Finder","Mostrar en el Finder","Afficher dans le Finder","在访达中显示","Im Finder zeigen","Mostra nel Finder","Finder に表示","Finder에서 보기","Показать в Finder","在 Finder 中顯示","Toon in Finder","Mostrar no Finder","Finder'da göster"],
  "macSnapshotHint": ["Read OBS to load your real scene and source names. This scan changes nothing in OBS.","Lee OBS para cargar los nombres reales de tus escenas y fuentes. Esta lectura no cambia nada en OBS.","Lisez OBS pour charger les vrais noms de vos scènes et sources. Cette lecture ne modifie rien dans OBS.","读取 OBS 以载入真实的场景和来源名称。此次读取不会更改 OBS 中的任何内容。","Lesen Sie OBS, um Ihre echten Szenen- und Quellennamen zu laden. Dabei wird in OBS nichts geändert.","Leggi OBS per caricare i nomi reali di scene e sorgenti. Questa lettura non cambia nulla in OBS.","OBS を読み込んで、実際のシーン名とソース名を取得します。この読み込みで OBS は何も変わりません。","OBS를 읽어 실제 장면과 소스 이름을 불러오세요. 이 읽기는 OBS에서 아무것도 바꾸지 않습니다.","Прочитайте OBS, чтобы загрузить настоящие названия сцен и источников. Чтение ничего не меняет в OBS.","讀取 OBS 以載入真實的場景和來源名稱。此次讀取不會變更 OBS 中的任何內容。","Lees OBS om je echte scène- en bronnamen te laden. Deze scan wijzigt niets in OBS.","Leia o OBS para carregar os nomes reais das suas cenas e fontes. Esta leitura não muda nada no OBS.","Gerçek sahne ve kaynak adlarınızı yüklemek için OBS'i okuyun. Bu tarama OBS'te hiçbir şeyi değiştirmez."],
  "macStartObs": ["Start OBS Studio to read your scenes, or review the assignments below.","Abre OBS Studio para leer tus escenas, o revisa las asignaciones de abajo.","Démarrez OBS Studio pour lire vos scènes, ou vérifiez les affectations ci-dessous.","启动 OBS Studio 以读取场景，或查看下方的分配。","Starten Sie OBS Studio, um Ihre Szenen zu lesen, oder prüfen Sie die Zuweisungen unten.","Avvia OBS Studio per leggere le scene, oppure controlla le assegnazioni qui sotto.","OBS Studio を起動してシーンを読み込むか、下の割り当てを確認してください。","OBS Studio를 실행해 장면을 읽거나 아래 할당을 확인하세요.","Запустите OBS Studio, чтобы прочитать сцены, или проверьте назначения ниже.","啟動 OBS Studio 以讀取場景，或查看下方的指派。","Start OBS Studio om je scènes te lezen, of bekijk de toewijzingen hieronder.","Inicie o OBS Studio para ler suas cenas, ou revise as atribuições abaixo.","Sahnelerinizi okumak için OBS Studio'yu başlatın veya aşağıdaki atamaları gözden geçirin."],
  "macTbCallout": ["1. Click the middle Import icon","1. Clic en el icono Import central","1. Cliquez sur l’icône Import centrale","1. 点击中间的 Import 图标","1. Mittleres Import-Symbol klicken","1. Fai clic sull’icona Import centrale","1. 中央の Import アイコンをクリック","1. 가운데 Import 아이콘 클릭","1. Нажмите среднюю иконку Import","1. 按一下中間的 Import 圖示","1. Klik op het middelste pictogram Import","1. Clique no ícone do meio, Import","1. Ortadaki Import simgesine tıklayın"],
