  "obsUiEnable": ["Enable WebSocket server","Habilitar servidor WebSocket","Activer le serveur WebSocket","启用 WebSocket 服务器","WebSocket-Server aktivieren","Abilita server WebSocket","WebSocket サーバーを有効にする","WebSocket 서버 활성화","Включить сервер WebSocket","啟用 WebSocket 伺服器","WebSocket-server inschakelen","Ativar servidor WebSocket","WebSocket sunucusunu etkinleştir"],
